From: mscharged-port
Subject: Recharged's trophy room: a set called off during its search goes back to the room
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

A set's search that the set's end leaves (0058) goes out of the online
menus, as the online menu's LOG OUT does (0063): the player has to log in
again. A set searched from Recharged's trophy room (0075: its way back is
the online menu) now goes back to the online menu instead, as the search's
Back does there, whose room is still there; its page comes again.

diff --git a/src/Game/SH/SHOnlineMatchmakingDraft.cpp b/src/Game/SH/SHOnlineMatchmakingDraft.cpp
index 91aa4c6..e045810 100644
--- a/src/Game/SH/SHOnlineMatchmakingDraft.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/SH/SHOnlineMatchmakingDraft.cpp
@@ -420,6 +420,14 @@ void SHOnlineMatchmakingDraft::Update(float fDeltaT)
     {
         CancelOnlineMatchmaking();
         FEAudio::StopAnimAudioEvent(0x89B1FC93, (void*)0x2A);
+        // A set's search from Recharged's trophy room (tweak patch 0075):
+        // back to the online menu, whose room is still there, as its Back.
+        if (mReturnScene == SCENE_ONLINE_MENU)
+        {
+            GameSceneManager::Instance()->Push(SCENE_ONLINE_MENU, SCREEN_BACK, true);
+            FEMusic::StartStreamIfDifferent(8);
+            return;
+        }
         GameSceneManager::Instance()->Pop();
         FEAudio::PlayAnimAudioEvent(0x4430B152, 0, 0, true);
         FrontEndPresentation::GetInstance()->Call("TransitionOnlineMatchToMainMenu");
